  "details": "Calendar is being spammed with massive amounts of \"Featured\" events making it annoying to use. I never added such events, I don't wanna see them.\n\nHaving an option setting to hide all such \"featured\" events from my own calendar so that they no longer show until I turn the setting back on again would be welcome.\n\nThe filter setting in calendar view is not enough because the filter is not remembered. Also there's no way to hide \"Featured\" events from the \"Your Events\" view in the homepage.",
